-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5a5b1720-98c1-407e-a440-450bce231183\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5e5ce5f3-41f0-4657-b388-9c996b781c5a\">​게임을 완전히 종료하신 후 재접속하여</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bc0a59a1-6895-43a7-b89b-84ed235b1fda\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-149e2dff-1079-4572-852c-17953901d014\">업데이트 리소스를 다운로드해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-12522560-6ef9-4594-8a7b-0693823d4eb3\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b8d642c6-5e8d-4e26-97c8-f99cc155b197\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aac99fd5-9fb3-4abe-bf95-07355ad2d746\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d9916ab7-ab10-47ba-ab24-dd38e6a399b9\">​​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d7a1af2-bf04-46c1-8f43-82b53e15727a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-526392a3-da48-4eb0-90ca-3300594b5e1d\"><b>📢 10/31(금) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​​​​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b7bde0b2-c16b-4d43-aabb-e8235e66d49a\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c29d0144-ed6d-428f-896d-022834af2652\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c84b31bf-f8ab-4ba6-b982-a5a6a087dbed\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-873d7257-7f7a-4b35-8941-b7170e8016c7\"><b>​​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0c65d24c-c18c-48de-8fa6-56a8dee322b5\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9cb072df-6de2-4d0b-a0db-1af79c96f204\">- 10/31(금) 17:00 ~ 19:00 경​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-aaec016f-80eb-4f52-aad4-4c6f758716a0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d61726e0-8d32-41cc-ab7a-bac49de73acc\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3c2d79c4-37c2-4259-b269-5264e51526c6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a28ff88e-55d7-4c2a-9c49-799e1145c2c3\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1dfd7f9f-bdfd-4c3d-9394-239e7de09bf4\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-df9b6cf3-4ddf-480b-a780-051e94846bb3\">1. 시뮬레이션 룸에서 [즉시 완료] 기능을 활성화하여 퀵 시뮬레이션을 즉시 완료할 경우, [시뮬레이션 룸 1회 도전] 일일미션이 완료되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5264c62b-50ec-4bc1-b984-78a3169379d2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-4955fe22-10c2-4d63-9187-d8b0e5c06af4\">2. 지상 연구 진행 중, 지상에 재진입할 경우 남은 연구시간이 잘못 표시되거나 완료된 것으로 보이는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-a57505fb-887a-4e02-8622-68087142d592\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ef4f6749-67b3-4868-862e-835ae8e2bfc6\">3. 특정 상황에서 지상의 제작 미션 횟수가 올라가지 않을 경우, 지상 재진입 시 갱신되도록 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-bd713493-0140-4002-8870-a19a12bf05ef\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e02def07-79bf-4ddc-9152-9f463c35f929\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c5d5a8df-43b5-46c5-be01-9e389d61b6a1\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-e3038320-81f0-41e7-bf02-c67b733cd01e\">​​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d220ed2b-4b7c-4a5d-bfc5-350e6e77b358\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-ea28c21d-e593-4aac-baaf-6bf5053f9079\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-78c44a93-65df-417d-bc86-aefd9ed99b7e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-deeddf08-4e13-4f7a-a16f-9a7cb9cf5154\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-d0468326-8998-48fd-a9b3-133caf7e6464\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-67fbe27e-d6ec-43bc-8819-4513040563b3\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-19a9655e-0ed6-40d1-89ee-ac2d4a76695e\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fee82a22-86b3-4721-8334-92d1c97ea805\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\